BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 545.0 Td (amount`\) and the debit \(`balance -= amount`\) are two separate operations - not atomic. Two) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 533.5 Td (threads both pass the check, then both debit. **Race condition.** Fix: use database-level) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 522.0 Td (locking or optimistic concurrency.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.5 Tf 0.35 0.45 0.55 rg 50 506.5 Td (Step 3: Form a Hypothesis) Tj ET
