BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 477.0 Td (This forces clarity. Vague hypotheses \("something is wrong with the payment code"\) lead to) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 465.5 Td (vague fixes.) Tj ET
