BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 438.5 Td (processes the same webhook event twice when the payment gateway retries, and we have no) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 427.0 Td (idempotency check."*) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.5 Tf 0.35 0.45 0.55 rg 50 411.5 Td (Step 4: Test the Hypothesis) Tj ET
