BT /F3 7.5 Tf 0.8 0.88 0.95 rg 58 571.0 Td (1. What are the quality attributes? \(availability, latency, security, scalability\)) Tj ET
BT /F3 7.5 Tf 0.8 0.88 0.95 rg 58 561.5 Td (2. What are the constraints? \(team size, deadline, budget, regulatory\)) Tj ET
BT /F3 7.5 Tf 0.8 0.88 0.95 rg 58 552.0 Td (3. What is the rate of change? \(stable domain vs. evolving requirements\)) Tj ET
BT /F3 7.5 Tf 0.8 0.88 0.95 rg 58 542.5 Td (4. What are the failure modes? \(what breaks? what's the impact?\)) Tj ET
BT /F3 7.5 Tf 0.8 0.88 0.95 rg 58 533.0 Td (5. What is the data model? \(relational, document, time-series, graph?\)) Tj ET
