BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.18 0.2 0.25 rg 62 485.5 Td (**The Monolithic `mscorlib.dll` & Base Class Library \(BCL\):**) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 472.5 Td (In .NET Framework, core primitives \(`System.String`, `System.Int32`\), reflection, cryptography,) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 461.0 Td (collections, file I/O, and threading lived inside a monolithic binary called `mscorlib.dll`.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 449.5 Td (Because `mscorlib` was tightly coupled to the specific installed version of the runtime,) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 438.0 Td (upgrading a single security patch or library required an in-place machine-wide update that) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 426.5 Td (risked breaking every other application running on the same Windows host.) Tj ET
0.2 0.5 0.85 rg 53 413.0 3 3 re f
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.18 0.2 0.25 rg 62 411.0 Td (**The Global Assembly Cache \(GAC\) Hell:**) Tj ET
