BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 331.5 Td (In the older `IHostBuilder` model, configuration and services were configured via nested lambda) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 320.0 Td (delegates \(`builder.ConfigureServices\(\(ctx, services\) => ...\)`\). This required building multiple) Tj ET
