BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 293.0 Td (`WebApplicationBuilder` simplifies this into a flat, readable API where `builder.Services` and) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 281.5 Td (`builder.Configuration` are exposed as direct properties, avoiding redundant allocations.) Tj ET
