BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.18 0.2 0.25 rg 62 565.0 Td (for immutable infrastructural settings \(e.g., database connection strings, server port) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.18 0.2 0.25 rg 62 554.0 Td (limits\).) Tj ET
0.2 0.5 0.85 rg 53 543.0 3 3 re f
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.18 0.2 0.25 rg 62 541.0 Td (**`IOptionsSnapshot<T>`:** Registered as a **Scoped** service. For every incoming HTTP) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.18 0.2 0.25 rg 62 530.0 Td (request, it re-reads configuration sources. If an operator changes `appsettings.json` on) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.18 0.2 0.25 rg 62 519.0 Td (disk, the very next HTTP request reads the new values, while all components executing) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.18 0.2 0.25 rg 62 508.0 Td (within the *current* request observe an immutable snapshot.) Tj ET
