BT /F2 9.5 Tf 0.35 0.45 0.55 rg 50 182.0 Td (10.3 High-Throughput In-Memory Messaging via `System.Threading.Channels`) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 168.0 Td (When building high-performance decoupled pipelines \(such as ingesting 100,000 credit card) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 156.5 Td (transaction webhooks per second and processing them in the background\), relying on naive thread) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 145.0 Td (synchronization \(`lock`, `Monitor`\) or thread-blocking collections \(`BlockingCollection<T>`\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 133.5 Td (causes extreme CPU contention and thread pool exhaustion.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 118.0 Td (**`System.Threading.Channels<T>`** provides a lock-free, zero-allocation asynchronous) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 106.5 Td (producer-consumer channel based on hardware memory barriers and interlocked operations.) Tj ET
