BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 700.5 Td (Guarantees absolute thread safety and security for text data, while modern abstractions) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 689.0 Td (\(`StringBuilder`, `Span<char>`\) prevent severe memory fragmentation and GC churn during) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 677.5 Td (high-volume text manipulation.) Tj ET
