0.2 0.5 0.85 rg 53 757.0 3 3 re f
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.18 0.2 0.25 rg 62 755.0 Td (**Overwriting Delegates:** Confusing a public delegate field with an event, allowing) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.18 0.2 0.25 rg 62 744.0 Td (consumers to wipe out listeners with `=`.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.5 Tf 0.35 0.45 0.55 rg 50 731.0 Td (11. Production Problems) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 717.0 Td (**Problem:** In an enterprise trading portal, client workstation browser tabs were freezing) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 705.5 Td (with browser memory consumption exceeding 4GB after 8 hours of trading.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 690.0 Td (**Root Cause:** Order entry views subscribed to a singleton `MarketDataStream.PriceChanged`) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 678.5 Td (event using lambdas. When users closed an order entry tab, the ViewModel had no `Dispose` method) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 667.0 Td (to unsubscribe. Over 10,000 closed ViewModels and their underlying UI component trees remained) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 655.5 Td (pinned in Gen 2 heap by the singleton `MarketDataStream`.) Tj ET
