0.2 0.5 0.85 rg 53 212.5 3 3 re f
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.18 0.2 0.25 rg 62 210.5 Td (Make custom attribute classes `sealed` to prevent unintended inheritance and optimize) Tj ET
