BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 529.0 Td (The Garbage Collector possesses omniscience over managed memory \(allocations on the CLR heap\),) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 517.5 Td (but is completely blind to external operating system kernel handles, native memory allocations) Tj ET
