BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 471.5 Td (clean up unmanaged resources before death, but because finalization is non-deterministic and) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 460.0 Td (expensive, `IDisposable` was introduced for immediate, deterministic cleanup.) Tj ET
