BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 484.0 Td (Security Modules \(via PKCS#11 native C APIs\). A connection opens an unmanaged session handle in) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 472.5 Td (native C memory. Failing to deterministically release this session exhausts the physical HSM) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 461.0 Td (session capacity \(often limited to 256 concurrent connections\), taking down the entire credit) Tj ET
