BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.18 0.2 0.25 rg 62 504.5 Td (*Answer*: `Encoding.UTF8.GetBytes\("text"\)` allocates a new `byte[]` on the managed heap) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.18 0.2 0.25 rg 62 493.5 Td (at runtime and copies the encoded bytes. Using `"text"u8` is a C# 11 compiler feature that) Tj ET
