BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 359.5 Td (return`\) allow code to pass and return aliases to storage locations rather than copying values.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 348.0 Td (This provides the execution speed of pointer manipulation while maintaining managed type safety) Tj ET
