BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 530.5 Td (culminating in pod restarts.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 515.0 Td (**Root Cause**: A developer spawned background consumer tasks listening to a channel:) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 499.5 Td (`Task.Run\(async \(\) => { while\(await reader.WaitToReadAsync\(\)\) { ... } }\);`) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 484.0 Td (When the parent connection was closed, the code stopped writing to the channel but never called) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 472.5 Td (`_channel.Writer.Complete\(\)`, nor did it pass a `CancellationToken` to `WaitToReadAsync\(\)`. As) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 461.0 Td (millions of temporary client connections were opened and closed, millions of abandoned consumer) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 449.5 Td (tasks remained suspended in memory, each holding references to their state machines.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 434.0 Td (**Post-Mortem Resolution**: Enforced passing `CancellationToken` to all channel read operations) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 422.5 Td (and implemented rigorous lifecycle disposal calling `_channel.Writer.Complete\(\)`.) Tj ET
