BT /F1 8.2 Tf 0.15 0.2 0.25 rg 62 244.0 Td (      These sound similar but are different. "One responsibility" is ambiguous - what counts) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 0.15 0.2 0.25 rg 62 233.0 Td (as one? "One reason to change" is precise - it means one *actor* \(business stakeholder\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 0.15 0.2 0.25 rg 62 222.0 Td (who can demand changes. A `ReportGenerator` has one reason to change: the reporting) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 0.15 0.2 0.25 rg 62 211.0 Td (requirements. When you hear "one responsibility," think: who would ask you to change) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 0.15 0.2 0.25 rg 62 200.0 Td (this? If the answer is "my DBA AND my marketing team," SRP is violated.) Tj ET
