BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 174.5 Td (**"High-level modules should not depend on low-level modules. Both should depend on) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 163.0 Td (abstractions."** - Robert C. Martin) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 147.5 Td (High-level = business logic. Low-level = database, email, HTTP clients. Both should depend on) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 136.0 Td (*interfaces*.) Tj ET
