BT /F2 8 Tf 0.15 0.45 0.85 rg 62 698.5 Td ([NOTE]) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 0.15 0.2 0.25 rg 62 698.5 Td (      During registration, `ServiceDescriptor` objects are added to a `ServiceCollection`. At) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 0.15 0.2 0.25 rg 62 687.5 Td (startup, `ServiceCollection.BuildServiceProvider\(\)` compiles these into a) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 0.15 0.2 0.25 rg 62 676.5 Td (`ServiceProvider`. When `GetRequiredService<T>\(\)` is called, the provider finds the) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 0.15 0.2 0.25 rg 62 665.5 Td (descriptor for T, uses reflection to examine the implementation type's constructor,) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 0.15 0.2 0.25 rg 62 654.5 Td (recursively resolves each parameter, creates the instance, and manages its lifetime) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 0.15 0.2 0.25 rg 62 643.5 Td (\(scoped in a dictionary, singleton in root scope\).) Tj ET
