BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.18 0.2 0.25 rg 62 300.5 Td (allocations and GC pauses. `System.IO.Pipelines` moves memory ownership to the runtime,) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.18 0.2 0.25 rg 62 289.5 Td (reusing pooled memory segments indefinitely.) Tj ET
