BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 118.0 Td (**Answer:** At startup, ASP.NET Core compiles all registered route templates into a DFA tree) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 106.5 Td (structure where nodes represent path segments. When a request arrives, the engine splits the URL) Tj ET
