BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.18 0.2 0.25 rg 62 158.0 Td (**Senior:** *How does the `[ApiController]` attribute alter the default model validation) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.18 0.2 0.25 rg 62 147.0 Td (behavior in ASP.NET Core?*) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 134.0 Td (**Answer:** When a controller is decorated with `[ApiController]`, the framework automatically) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 122.5 Td (registers an action filter called `ModelStateInvalidFilter`. If `ModelState.IsValid` evaluates) Tj ET
