BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.18 0.2 0.25 rg 62 374.5 Td (regardless of framework: Request Correlation ID, Security Headers, HTTPS redirection,) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.18 0.2 0.25 rg 62 363.5 Td (Global Rate Limiting, Exception handling, and static file serving.) Tj ET
