BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.18 0.2 0.25 rg 62 489.5 Td (**Intermediate:** *What is the difference between `[ServiceFilter]` and `[TypeFilter]`?*) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 476.5 Td (**Answer:** Both allow dependency injection into filter attributes. `[ServiceFilter]` resolves) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 465.0 Td (the filter instance directly from the DI container, meaning the filter must be registered in) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 453.5 Td (`IServiceCollection`. `[TypeFilter]` does not require DI registration; it uses) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 442.0 Td (`ActivatorUtilities` to instantiate the filter per request, resolving any constructor) Tj ET
