BT /F2 9.5 Tf 0.35 0.45 0.55 rg 50 790.0 Td (8. Design Reasoning) Tj ET
0.2 0.5 0.85 rg 53 778.0 3 3 re f
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.18 0.2 0.25 rg 62 776.0 Td (**The Fail-Fast Principle with `ValidateOnStart\(\)`**:) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 763.0 Td (Without `ValidateOnStart\(\)`, missing configuration values remain undetected until hours later) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 751.5 Td (when a customer triggers an execution path that attempts to read `options.Value.ApiKey`, causing) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 740.0 Td (a production crash. `ValidateOnStart\(\)` guarantees that if an environment variable is omitted in) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 728.5 Td (a Kubernetes deployment manifest, the container pod crashes during startup probe checks,) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 717.0 Td (preventing deployment of a broken release.) Tj ET
0.2 0.5 0.85 rg 53 703.5 3 3 re f
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.18 0.2 0.25 rg 62 701.5 Td (**Why Avoid Injecting `IConfiguration` Directly**:) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 688.5 Td (Injecting `IConfiguration` into controllers or services violates Encapsulation and introduces) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 677.0 Td (stringly-typed anti-patterns \(`_config["Database:Port"]`\). It prevents unit testing without) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 665.5 Td (mocking complex key-value hierarchies. Always use strongly-typed Options classes.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.5 Tf 0.35 0.45 0.55 rg 50 650.0 Td (9. Performance Considerations) Tj ET
0.2 0.5 0.85 rg 53 638.0 3 3 re f
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.18 0.2 0.25 rg 62 636.0 Td (**`IOptions` Allocation**: `IOptions<T>` is instantiated once as a Singleton; accessing) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.18 0.2 0.25 rg 62 625.0 Td (`.Value` is a simple reference fetch with zero allocations.) Tj ET
0.2 0.5 0.85 rg 53 614.0 3 3 re f
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.18 0.2 0.25 rg 62 612.0 Td (**`IOptionsSnapshot` Overhead**: `IOptionsSnapshot<T>` evaluates bindings once per HTTP) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.18 0.2 0.25 rg 62 601.0 Td (request. Avoid reading options in hot inner loops; cache `.Value` in a local variable.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.5 Tf 0.35 0.45 0.55 rg 50 588.0 Td (10. Common Mistakes) Tj ET
0.2 0.5 0.85 rg 53 576.0 3 3 re f
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.18 0.2 0.25 rg 62 574.0 Td (**Committing Secrets to Git**: Storing passwords or API keys in `appsettings.json` and) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.18 0.2 0.25 rg 62 563.0 Td (committing them to source control.) Tj ET
0.2 0.5 0.85 rg 53 552.0 3 3 re f
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.18 0.2 0.25 rg 62 550.0 Td (**Using Single Colons in Docker Environment Variables**: Setting `Database:Host` in Linux) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.18 0.2 0.25 rg 62 539.0 Td (Docker containers. Linux shells drop or corrupt environment variables containing colons;) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.18 0.2 0.25 rg 62 528.0 Td (use double-underscores \(`Database__Host`\).) Tj ET
0.2 0.5 0.85 rg 53 517.0 3 3 re f
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.18 0.2 0.25 rg 62 515.0 Td (**Injecting `IOptionsSnapshot` into Singletons**: `IOptionsSnapshot` is scoped) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.18 0.2 0.25 rg 62 504.0 Td (per-request. Injecting it into a Singleton service throws an `InvalidOperationException`) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.18 0.2 0.25 rg 62 493.0 Td (due to captive dependency validation. Use `IOptionsMonitor<T>` in Singletons.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.5 Tf 0.35 0.45 0.55 rg 50 480.0 Td (11. Real-World Production Problem: The Silent Kubernetes Deploy Outage) Tj ET
0.2 0.5 0.85 rg 53 468.0 3 3 re f
