BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.18 0.2 0.25 rg 62 455.0 Td (customers attempting checkout encountered `500 Internal Server Error`.) Tj ET
0.2 0.5 0.85 rg 53 444.0 3 3 re f
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.18 0.2 0.25 rg 62 442.0 Td (**Root Cause**: The DevOps engineer forgot to include `PaymentGateway__ApiKey` in the) Tj ET
