BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.18 0.2 0.25 rg 62 210.5 Td (variables?*) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 197.5 Td (**Answer:** In JSON, hierarchies use colons \(e.g., `"Logging:LogLevel:Default"`\). Because) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 186.0 Td (standard Linux shells do not support colons in environment variable names, ASP.NET Core maps) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 174.5 Td (double underscores \(`__`\) to colons. Thus, `Logging__LogLevel__Default=Warning` binds to) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 163.0 Td (`Logging:LogLevel:Default`.) Tj ET
0.2 0.5 0.85 rg 53 149.5 3 3 re f
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.18 0.2 0.25 rg 62 147.5 Td (**Senior:** *What is `ValidateOnStart\(\)` in the Options pattern, and why is it essential) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.18 0.2 0.25 rg 62 136.5 Td (for enterprise cloud deployments?*) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 123.5 Td (**Answer:** `ValidateOnStart\(\)` forces the DI container to instantiate and validate all) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 112.0 Td (registered Options configurations when the application boots, rather than deferring evaluation) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 100.5 Td (to the first request. If required configuration keys are missing or fail DataAnnotation rules,) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 89.0 Td (the application crashes immediately. In Kubernetes, this causes the container to fail its) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 77.5 Td (startup/readiness probes, blocking rollouts and preventing broken pods from serving customer) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 66.0 Td (traffic.) Tj ET
