BT /F2 9.5 Tf 0.35 0.45 0.55 rg 50 641.5 Td (1. Definition) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 627.5 Td (**Logging and Observability** in ASP.NET Core is the architectural discipline of generating,) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 616.0 Td (enriching, and exporting structured runtime telemetry-encompassing **Structured Logging**) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 604.5 Td (\(`ILogger`\), **Distributed Tracing** \(`ActivitySource`, OpenTelemetry, W3C TraceContext\), and) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 593.0 Td (**Metrics** \(`Meter`\)-to monitor application health, trace requests across distributed) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 581.5 Td (microservice boundaries, and enable instant root-cause analysis in centralized log aggregation) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 570.0 Td (systems \(Seq, Elasticsearch, Datadog\).) Tj ET
