BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 439.0 Td (String interpolation immediately concatenates strings using `string.Format`, allocating a new) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 427.5 Td (string on the heap even if the `Information` log level is disabled. Crucially, the indexing) Tj ET
