BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 336.0 Td (*before* reading parameters. It avoids boxing value types \(such as `decimal` or `int`\) into) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 324.5 Td (`object` arrays, making log calls virtually free when logging is disabled.) Tj ET
