0.2 0.5 0.85 rg 53 181.0 3 3 re f
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.18 0.2 0.25 rg 62 179.0 Td (Exception filters only caught errors inside MVC controllers, failing to catch errors) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.18 0.2 0.25 rg 62 168.0 Td (thrown in middleware, routing, authentication, or serialization.) Tj ET
0.2 0.5 0.85 rg 53 157.0 3 3 re f
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.18 0.2 0.25 rg 62 155.0 Td (Error payloads were inconsistent: some endpoints returned `{ "error": "msg" }`, others `{) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.18 0.2 0.25 rg 62 144.0 Td ("message": "fail" }`, and unhandled crashes exposed raw C# stack traces and SQL queries.) Tj ET
0.2 0.5 0.85 rg 53 133.0 3 3 re f
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.18 0.2 0.25 rg 62 131.0 Td (ASP.NET Core standardized on `UseExceptionHandler`, and .NET 8 introduced) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.18 0.2 0.25 rg 62 120.0 Td (`IExceptionHandler` to provide a clean, extensible, chain-of-responsibility pattern for) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.18 0.2 0.25 rg 62 109.0 Td (error translation.) Tj ET
