BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.18 0.2 0.25 rg 62 417.5 Td (**Why Policy-Based Beats Role-Based**:) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 404.5 Td (Role-based authorization \(`[Authorize\(Roles = "Admin,ChiefOfMedicine"\)]`\) couples your code to) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 393.0 Td (arbitrary identity provider naming schemes. If the enterprise renames `"ChiefOfMedicine"` to) Tj ET
