BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 370.0 Td (the requirement \(`"CanAuthorizePrescription"`\) from the role. You can alter which roles or) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 358.5 Td (claims satisfy the policy in `Program.cs` without altering any controllers.) Tj ET
0.2 0.5 0.85 rg 53 345.0 3 3 re f
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.18 0.2 0.25 rg 62 343.0 Td (**Resource-Based Authorization**:) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 330.0 Td (Declarative attributes \(`[Authorize]`\) cannot evaluate business entities that haven't been) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 318.5 Td (fetched from the database yet. Resource-based authorization evaluates permissions imperatively) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 307.0 Td (*after* the entity is retrieved from the database, preventing unauthorized horizontal privilege) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 295.5 Td (escalation \(Insecure Direct Object Reference - IDOR\).) Tj ET
