BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.18 0.2 0.25 rg 62 263.0 Td (**Basic:** *What is the difference between `IMemoryCache` and `IDistributedCache` in) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.18 0.2 0.25 rg 62 252.0 Td (ASP.NET Core?*) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 239.0 Td (**Answer:** `IMemoryCache` stores objects directly in the memory \(RAM\) of the single web server) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 227.5 Td (process running the application. It is fast \(nanoseconds\) but is lost when the app restarts and) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 216.0 Td (is not shared across multi-server web farms. `IDistributedCache` stores serialized data \(bytes) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 204.5 Td (or strings\) in an external shared cache \(such as Redis or SQL Server\), ensuring all application) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 193.0 Td (instances in a cloud cluster access the identical cache state.) Tj ET
0.2 0.5 0.85 rg 53 179.5 3 3 re f
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.18 0.2 0.25 rg 62 177.5 Td (**Intermediate:** *What is a "Cache Stampede" \(Thundering Herd problem\), and how do you) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.18 0.2 0.25 rg 62 166.5 Td (prevent it in C#?*) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 153.5 Td (**Answer:** A cache stampede occurs when a heavily accessed cache key expires, and hundreds or) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 142.0 Td (thousands of concurrent requests experience a cache miss simultaneously. All requests proceed to) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 130.5 Td (execute the expensive database query at the exact same moment, causing database CPU spikes and) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 119.0 Td (connection pool starvation. It is prevented using **Resource Locking** \(such as `SemaphoreSlim`) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 107.5 Td (or Redis distributed locks with RedLock\) and double-checked locking, ensuring only one thread) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 96.0 Td (executes the database query while other concurrent threads wait and read the freshly cached) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 84.5 Td (result.) Tj ET
0.2 0.5 0.85 rg 53 71.0 3 3 re f
