BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.18 0.2 0.25 rg 62 554.5 Td (Microsoft partnered with Google to make ASP.NET Core a premier first-class hosting) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.18 0.2 0.25 rg 62 543.5 Td (environment for gRPC, providing a modern, cross-platform replacement for WCF that is) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.18 0.2 0.25 rg 62 532.5 Td (dramatically faster than REST.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.5 Tf 0.35 0.45 0.55 rg 50 519.5 Td (3. Problem It Solves) Tj ET
0.2 0.5 0.85 rg 53 507.5 3 3 re f
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.18 0.2 0.25 rg 62 505.5 Td (**Contract-First Rigor**: Enforces strict schemas via `.proto` files, eliminating runtime) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.18 0.2 0.25 rg 62 494.5 Td (contract drift between microservices across different languages \(C#, Go, Java, Python\).) Tj ET
0.2 0.5 0.85 rg 53 483.5 3 3 re f
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.18 0.2 0.25 rg 62 481.5 Td (**Compact Binary Serialization**: Protocol Buffers serialize data into binary integers) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.18 0.2 0.25 rg 62 470.5 Td (and tags rather than text strings, reducing payload sizes by 60% to 80%.) Tj ET
0.2 0.5 0.85 rg 53 459.5 3 3 re f
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.18 0.2 0.25 rg 62 457.5 Td (**HTTP/2 Connection Multiplexing**: Allows hundreds of concurrent RPC requests to share a) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.18 0.2 0.25 rg 62 446.5 Td (single long-lived TCP socket without Head-of-Line blocking.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.5 Tf 0.35 0.45 0.55 rg 50 433.5 Td (4. Internal Working) Tj ET
0.2 0.5 0.85 rg 53 421.5 3 3 re f
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.18 0.2 0.25 rg 62 419.5 Td (**The Protobuf Compiler \(`protoc`\)**:) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 406.5 Td (During build, the `Grpc.Tools` MSBuild task compiles `.proto` files into strongly-typed C#) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 395.0 Td (message classes and abstract base service classes.) Tj ET
0.2 0.5 0.85 rg 53 381.5 3 3 re f
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.18 0.2 0.25 rg 62 379.5 Td (**HTTP/2 Framing & HPACK**:) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 366.5 Td (Every gRPC call is an HTTP/2 `POST` request. Headers are compressed using **HPACK**. Request) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 355.0 Td (and response bodies are framed into binary `DATA` frames prefixed with a 5-byte length-delimited) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 343.5 Td (header \(1 byte compression flag + 4 bytes big-endian length\).) Tj ET
0.2 0.5 0.85 rg 53 330.0 3 3 re f
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.18 0.2 0.25 rg 62 328.0 Td (**Kestrel gRPC Dispatcher**:) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 315.0 Td (Kestrel receives the binary frames on an HTTP/2 stream, skips string conversions, deserializes) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 303.5 Td (the Protobuf bytes directly into C# objects using zero-allocation spans, and invokes the) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 292.0 Td (generated service class.) Tj ET
0.2 0.5 0.85 rg 53 278.5 3 3 re f
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.18 0.2 0.25 rg 62 276.5 Td (**Deadlines and Cancellation**:) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 263.5 Td (gRPC natively supports **Deadlines** \(`CallOptions.WithDeadline`\). The client passes a timeout) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 252.0 Td (header \(`grpc-timeout`\), and if the deadline expires, both client and server cancel their) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 240.5 Td (respective `CancellationToken` instances automatically.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.5 Tf 0.35 0.45 0.55 rg 50 225.0 Td (5. Real Production Example: Core Banking Ledger Microservices) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 211.0 Td (In a high-frequency banking architecture:) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 195.5 Td (The `TransactionIngestionService` validates and submits ledger entries to the) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 184.0 Td (`CoreLedgerService`. With over 30,000 transactions per second, REST+JSON saturated network links) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 172.5 Td (and caused CPU spikes from JSON parsing. Migrating to gRPC over HTTP/2 reduced network bandwidth) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 161.0 Td (by 72% and cut P99 inter-service latency from 18ms to 1.8ms.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.5 Tf 0.35 0.45 0.55 rg 50 145.5 Td (6. Production C# Code: Protobuf Contract, Server Implementation & Client Deadlines) Tj ET
