BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 651.5 Td (**API Versioning** in ASP.NET Core is the architectural discipline of evolving RESTful API) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 640.0 Td (contracts, data models, and behaviors over time without breaking existing client integrations) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 628.5 Td (\(mobile apps, third-party consumers, legacy frontends\). It is officially implemented using the) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 617.0 Td (**`Asp.Versioning.Http`** and **`Asp.Versioning.Mvc`** packages, supporting four primary) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 605.5 Td (strategies: **URI Path**, **Query String**, **HTTP Header**, and **Accept/Media-Type**) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 594.0 Td (versioning.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.5 Tf 0.35 0.45 0.55 rg 50 578.5 Td (2. Historical Reason) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 564.5 Td (In early API development:) Tj ET
0.2 0.5 0.85 rg 53 551.0 3 3 re f
