0.2 0.5 0.85 rg 53 527.0 3 3 re f
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.18 0.2 0.25 rg 62 525.0 Td (This led to code duplication, broken Swagger/OpenAPI specifications, inability to) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.18 0.2 0.25 rg 62 514.0 Td (deprecate endpoints systematically, and no standardized way to report supported versions) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.18 0.2 0.25 rg 62 503.0 Td (to API consumers.) Tj ET
0.2 0.5 0.85 rg 53 492.0 3 3 re f
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.18 0.2 0.25 rg 62 490.0 Td (The official ASP.NET API Versioning library was created to integrate version negotiation) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.18 0.2 0.25 rg 62 479.0 Td (directly into the Endpoint Routing DFA matching engine.) Tj ET
