0.2 0.5 0.85 rg 53 454.0 3 3 re f
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.18 0.2 0.25 rg 62 452.0 Td (**Contract Stability**: Guarantees that updates to request/response schemas do not break) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.18 0.2 0.25 rg 62 441.0 Td (production mobile apps that cannot be updated immediately.) Tj ET
0.2 0.5 0.85 rg 53 430.0 3 3 re f
