BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.18 0.2 0.25 rg 62 190.0 Td (and why?*) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 177.0 Td (**Answer:** **URI Path Versioning** is the industry standard for public-facing enterprise APIs.) Tj ET
