BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 675.5 Td (*Symptom:* The import took 45 minutes and pegged server CPU at 100%.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 660.0 Td (*Root Cause:* Calling `Add\(\)` repeatedly caused EF Core to re-scan all previously added) Tj ET
