BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 134.0 Td (In early ORM designs, every queried entity was automatically wired for bi-directional change) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 122.5 Td (tracking. As Web APIs evolved into stateless REST microservices where 80%+ of incoming requests) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 111.0 Td (are read-only \(fetching data to serialize into JSON DTOs\), tracking overhead became an enormous) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 99.5 Td (waste of server resources. EF Core promoted `.AsNoTracking\(\)` to a primary performance) Tj ET
