0.2 0.5 0.85 rg 53 342.5 3 3 re f
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.18 0.2 0.25 rg 62 340.5 Td (**Answer:** It acts as an internal ledger storing the unique IDs of all migrations) Tj ET
