0.2 0.5 0.85 rg 53 283.5 3 3 re f
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.18 0.2 0.25 rg 62 281.5 Td (**Answer:** In containerized and clustered environments with multiple application) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.18 0.2 0.25 rg 62 270.5 Td (instances running, concurrent calls to `Database.Migrate\(\)` cause race conditions, schema) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.18 0.2 0.25 rg 62 259.5 Td (metadata corruption, and database deadlocks.) Tj ET
