0.2 0.5 0.85 rg 53 143.5 3 3 re f
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.18 0.2 0.25 rg 62 141.5 Td (**Answer:** It does not inspect the live database. It compares your current C#) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.18 0.2 0.25 rg 62 130.5 Td (`DbContext` model configuration against the local `DbContextModelSnapshot.cs` file in your) Tj ET
