BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 727.0 Td (SQL Server allows `SET DELAYED_DURABILITY = FORCED`. This writes log buffers asynchronously to) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 715.5 Td (disk, boosting transaction throughput by 400%. However, if the server loses power, all) Tj ET
