BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 449.5 Td (The fundamental architectural law to eradicate deadlocks is: **Every transaction across the) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 438.0 Td (entire engineering organization must access and lock resources in the exact same deterministic) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 426.5 Td (sequence.**) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 411.0 Td (If Transaction A and Transaction B both modify Table X first, then Table Y, a cyclic deadlock) Tj ET
