BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 388.0 Td (transaction waits cleanly on Table X without holding any conflicting locks on Table Y.) Tj ET
0.2 0.5 0.85 rg 53 374.5 3 3 re f
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.18 0.2 0.25 rg 62 372.5 Td (**Short-Lived Transactions:** Minimize the time between acquiring a lock and committing.) Tj ET
