BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.18 0.2 0.25 rg 62 159.0 Td (an "Accept TRUE" rule, meaning expressions evaluating to `UNKNOWN` are discarded.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 146.0 Td (#### 2. Why does `WHERE Col NOT IN \(SELECT Val FROM OtherTable\)` return zero rows if `Val`) Tj ET
