0.2 0.5 0.85 rg 53 658.0 3 3 re f
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.18 0.2 0.25 rg 62 656.0 Td (**Answer:** By using **Parameterized Queries**. Parameterization ensures that user input) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.18 0.2 0.25 rg 62 645.0 Td (is transmitted over the TDS protocol as discrete typed parameter values rather than) Tj ET
