BT /F1 8.2 Tf 0.15 0.2 0.25 rg 62 241.5 Td (      Choreography: decentralized, each service reacts to events, hard to visualize flow but) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 0.15 0.2 0.25 rg 62 230.5 Td (no SPOF. Orchestration: central state machine drives the saga, clear visibility, but) Tj ET
