BT /F1 8.2 Tf 0.15 0.2 0.25 rg 62 698.5 Td (      When you need: complete audit trail \(finance, healthcare\), temporal queries \(state at) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 0.15 0.2 0.25 rg 62 687.5 Td (time T\), event replay for new services, or complex domain with rich behavioral history.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 0.15 0.2 0.25 rg 62 676.5 Td (NOT for simple CRUD - it adds significant complexity.) Tj ET
