BT /F1 8.2 Tf 0.15 0.2 0.25 rg 62 628.0 Td (      When a downstream service is failing, without circuit breaker: every request waits for) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 0.15 0.2 0.25 rg 62 617.0 Td (timeout \(5s\), threads pile up, connection pools exhaust, upstream service also becomes) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 0.15 0.2 0.25 rg 62 606.0 Td (slow. With circuit breaker: after failure threshold, all requests fail immediately \(fast) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 0.15 0.2 0.25 rg 62 595.0 Td (fail\). Resources freed. After break duration, trial request sent - if succeeds, circuit) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 0.15 0.2 0.25 rg 62 584.0 Td (closes.) Tj ET
