BT /F1 8.2 Tf 0.15 0.2 0.25 rg 62 535.5 Td (      Each microservice's database makes a CAP trade-off. In an Order service using) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 0.15 0.2 0.25 rg 62 524.5 Td (PostgreSQL with synchronous replication: we favor Consistency over Availability. In a) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 0.15 0.2 0.25 rg 62 513.5 Td (Notification service using Cassandra: we favor Availability over Consistency.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 0.15 0.2 0.25 rg 62 502.5 Td (Microservices let each service choose its own CAP trade-off rather than a monolith's) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 0.15 0.2 0.25 rg 62 491.5 Td (one-size-fits-all.) Tj ET
