BT /F1 8.2 Tf 0.15 0.2 0.25 rg 62 432.0 Td (If any step fails, compensating transactions undo the previous steps. Eventual) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 0.15 0.2 0.25 rg 62 421.0 Td (consistency is accepted.) Tj ET
