BT /F2 8 Tf 0.15 0.45 0.85 rg 62 372.5 Td ([NOTE]) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 0.15 0.2 0.25 rg 62 372.5 Td (      Use a consistent partition key \(e.g., orderId or customerId\). All events for the same) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 0.15 0.2 0.25 rg 62 361.5 Td (entity land on the same partition, guaranteeing order. Never use random partition) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 0.15 0.2 0.25 rg 62 350.5 Td (assignment when ordering matters. One consumer per partition per consumer group - within) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 0.15 0.2 0.25 rg 62 339.5 Td (a partition, messages are always FIFO.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 316.5 Td (**Q: What's the difference between gRPC and REST? When would you use each?**) Tj ET
0.93 0.98 0.95 rg 50 243.0 495 58 re f
0.1 0.65 0.35 rg 50 243.0 4 58 re f
0.85 0.88 0.92 RG 0.5 w 50 243.0 495 58 re s
BT /F2 8 Tf 0.1 0.65 0.35 rg 62 291.0 Td ([TIP]) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 0.15 0.2 0.25 rg 62 291.0 Td (      REST over JSON: human-readable, universal browser support, good for public APIs. gRPC) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 0.15 0.2 0.25 rg 62 280.0 Td (over Protocol Buffers: binary \(~5x smaller payload\), strongly typed contracts, HTTP/2) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 0.15 0.2 0.25 rg 62 269.0 Td (multiplexing, streaming support. Use gRPC for internal service-to-service calls where) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 0.15 0.2 0.25 rg 62 258.0 Td (performance and schema enforcement matter. Use REST for public APIs and browser clients.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 50 235.0 Td (**Q: How does the Outbox pattern differ from 2PC?**) Tj ET
0.93 0.98 0.95 rg 50 161.5 495 58 re f
0.1 0.65 0.35 rg 50 161.5 4 58 re f
0.85 0.88 0.92 RG 0.5 w 50 161.5 495 58 re s
BT /F2 8 Tf 0.1 0.65 0.35 rg 62 209.5 Td ([TIP]) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 0.15 0.2 0.25 rg 62 209.5 Td (      2PC requires a distributed transaction coordinator and locks across multiple systems -) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 0.15 0.2 0.25 rg 62 198.5 Td (fragile and blocking. The Outbox pattern uses a single local transaction \(always fast) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 0.15 0.2 0.25 rg 62 187.5 Td (and safe\), then eventual delivery via a background publisher. It trades strict) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 0.15 0.2 0.25 rg 62 176.5 Td (consistency for resilience and simplicity.) Tj ET
