0.2 0.5 0.85 rg 53 542.5 3 3 re f
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.18 0.2 0.25 rg 62 540.5 Td (*Cons:* Adding or removing a shard requires resharding nearly 100% of all keys unless) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.18 0.2 0.25 rg 62 529.5 Td (consistent hashing is used.) Tj ET
0.2 0.5 0.85 rg 53 518.5 3 3 re f
