0.2 0.5 0.85 rg 53 505.5 3 3 re f
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.18 0.2 0.25 rg 62 503.5 Td (Sharding by continuous ranges \(e.g., CustomerId 1-1,000,000 to Shard 1;) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.18 0.2 0.25 rg 62 492.5 Td (1,000,001-2,000,000 to Shard 2\).) Tj ET
0.2 0.5 0.85 rg 53 481.5 3 3 re f
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.18 0.2 0.25 rg 62 479.5 Td (*Pros:* Range queries within a single shard are localized and fast.) Tj ET
0.2 0.5 0.85 rg 53 468.5 3 3 re f
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.18 0.2 0.25 rg 62 466.5 Td (*Cons:* Massive write hotspots \(all new monotonically increasing IDs hammer the newest) Tj ET
